# VITE_API_URL — API base URL
# Development (Vite proxy): leave empty, uses Vite dev server proxy
#   Vite proxy routes:
#     /api/v2  → http://localhost:3000/api/v2  (Fastify v2 routes)
#     /api     → http://localhost:3000/        (legacy routes, /api prefix stripped)
# Production (standalone): set to deployed backend URL
#   örn: VITE_API_URL=https://api.beta.localakademi.com
# When set, all API calls go directly to this absolute URL instead of the proxy.
# Do NOT put secrets or API keys here — they are exposed to the browser.
#VITE_API_URL=
